## Examples

Add a software record:

```sql
INSERT INTO software (name, version, license_type, renewal_date, notes)
VALUES ('Photo Editor', '5.2', 'One-time purchase', NULL, 'Bought online');


View all tracked software:

          
            
            
          
          SELECT name, version, license_type, renewal_date
FROM software
ORDER BY name;


Find subscriptions renewing in the next 30 days:

          
            
            
          
          SELECT name, renewal_date
FROM software
WHERE renewal_date BETWEEN date('now') AND date('now', '+30 days')
ORDER BY renewal_date;


